{"id":"018f538df00510ed","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-fun-pointwise-image.md","title":"ZFC Fun Pointwise Image","display":"df-zfc-fun-pointwise-image — ZFC Fun Pointwise Image","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-fun-pointwise-image","aliases":["58-df-zfc-fun-pointwise-image"],"display":"df-zfc-fun-pointwise-image — ZFC Fun Pointwise Image","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-fun-pointwise-image"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-fun-pointwise-image</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-fun-pointwise-image — ZFC Fun Pointwise Image"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,A,B\\in V\">\\(f,A,B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFunPointwiseImage}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFunPointwiseImage}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fun\\text{-}pointwise\\text{-}image} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFunPointwiseImage}_S(B,f,A)\\leftrightarrow \\exists D,C\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,D,C)\\land A\\subseteq D\\land B=\\{f(x)\\mid x\\in A\\}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fun\\text{-}pointwise\\text{-}image} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFunPointwiseImage}_S(B,f,A)\\leftrightarrow \\exists D,C\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,D,C)\\land A\\subseteq D\\land B=\\{f(x)\\mid x\\in A\\}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The image is defined extensionally on a chosen subset of the domain; the unused whole-range dependency was removed.</li>\n<li>The function guard now uses the upstream three-place signature with explicit domain and codomain witnesses.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Function}$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,A,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFunPointwiseImage}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}fun\\text{-}pointwise\\text{-}image} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFunPointwiseImage}_S(B,f,A)\\leftrightarrow \\exists D,C\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(f,D,C)\\land A\\subseteq D\\land B=\\{f(x)\\mid x\\in A\\}\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1003,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2142","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-fun-pointwise-image.md|58-df-zfc-fun-pointwise-image]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751"]}